{"schema_version":"1.0.0","metadata":{"trial_id":"202610080659-corner-cafe","prompting_method_id":"concept-build-free.v0","model_id":"claude-opus-5-5","seed":11,"server_state_id":"concept-free.v1"},"style":{"name":"The Corner Crumb — Café & Bakery: sandstone market-house with oak shopfront and striped brick corner tower","rationale":"The plan is 17x17. The streets lie on the -z and -x faces, and a notched 3x3 sandstone corner tower stands at x-1..1, z-1..1. The tower has brick bands at y4-5, 8-9 and 12-13. It rises past the parapet to a corbelled brick crown made of upside-down brick_stairs at y16 and a 5x5 brick deck at y17. A stepped stair pyramid at y18 carries a cut_sandstone finial and lantern. The door is beside the chamfer notch, under a hanging sign on a fence bracket, with pink and brown banners on cut_sandstone. Each street front has 3 bays of 3 between 2-wide cut_sandstone pilasters. The pilasters stand 1 block proud at z=-1 and x=-1, with stone-brick bases and chiseled caps. The walls are built by exclusion so every opening is a real recess. Shop glass sits 2 deep at y2-5 behind the pilaster face, split by a stripped-oak mullion. An oak band at y6 runs out to a 1-deep balcony with an oak_fence rail. The balcony rests on upside-down oak_stair brackets, with a lantern hung beneath and flower pots on the rail. Each lodging window has a cobblestone spandrel below, sits recessed between flush orange_terracotta shutters, and has an oak-clad attic light above. An upside-down oak_stair cornice runs at y12 with an oak_slab overhang at y13 that projects 2 blocks. The plank parapet carries sandstone piers over every pilaster, so each vertical line carries from the plinth to the sky. A brick oven chimney and a roof hatch sit on the roof. The -z street has a raised half-slab terrace with a fence rail, two stair-and-slab table sets and a stepped orange-and-white striped wool awning on posts. The -x street has barrels, a composter, a blue-and-white produce stall and a bracket sign. The paving is stone brick with a cobble band and a slab kerb. The back walls are plain sandstone with stringcourses and shuttered windows."},"palette":{"manifest":["minecraft:stone_bricks","minecraft:cobblestone","minecraft:stone_brick_slab","minecraft:oak_planks","minecraft:oak_slab","minecraft:oak_stairs","minecraft:oak_fence","minecraft:oak_door","minecraft:oak_trapdoor","minecraft:stripped_oak_log","minecraft:smooth_sandstone","minecraft:cut_sandstone","minecraft:chiseled_sandstone","minecraft:smooth_sandstone_slab","minecraft:bricks","minecraft:brick_stairs","minecraft:orange_terracotta","minecraft:glass_pane","minecraft:lantern","minecraft:oak_hanging_sign","minecraft:pink_wall_banner","minecraft:brown_wall_banner","minecraft:potted_red_tulip","minecraft:potted_poppy","minecraft:potted_azure_bluet","minecraft:orange_wool","minecraft:white_wool","minecraft:blue_wool","minecraft:barrel","minecraft:composter","minecraft:pumpkin","minecraft:melon"]},"placements":[{"op":"fill","from":[-3,0,-3],"to":[17,0,17],"block":"minecraft:stone_bricks"},{"op":"line","from":[-3,0,-2],"to":[17,0,-2],"block":"minecraft:cobblestone"},{"op":"line","from":[-2,0,-3],"to":[-2,0,17],"block":"minecraft:cobblestone"},{"op":"line","from":[-3,0,-3],"to":[17,0,-3],"block":"minecraft:stone_brick_slab","state":{"type":"bottom"}},{"op":"line","from":[-3,0,-3],"to":[-3,0,17],"block":"minecraft:stone_brick_slab","state":{"type":"bottom"}},{"op":"line","from":[2,0,-3],"to":[14,0,-3],"block":"minecraft:stone_bricks"},{"op":"line","from":[-3,0,7],"to":[-3,0,9],"block":"minecraft:stone_bricks"},{"op":"fill","from":[0,0,0],"to":[16,0,16],"block":"minecraft:oak_planks"},{"op":"fill","from":[2,1,-2],"to":[14,1,-1],"block":"minecraft:oak_slab","state":{"type":"bottom"}},{"op":"fill","from":[16,1,0],"to":[16,12,16],"block":"minecraft:smooth_sandstone"},{"op":"fill","from":[0,1,16],"to":[16,12,16],"block":"minecraft:smooth_sandstone"},{"op":"line","from":[16,1,0],"to":[16,1,16],"block":"mine